.* memo-external.gml - an external memo of the memo tag set
.* (share/gmlapp/memo): the receiver blocks (company and address
.* lines), the sender's address lines, MEMTYPE in full, :sign with a
.* name, a reference, no logo, no security classification.
:to name='Ms. Priya Raman' company='Harbourside Print Ltd.'
  addr1='14 Quay Street' addr2='Bristol BS1 4DJ' email='p.raman@harbourside.example'.
:from name='Tomás Ferreira' email='t.ferreira@example.org'
  addr1='Northgate Press, 3 Mill Lane' addr2='Leeds LS2 7HQ'
  title='Production Editor'.
:memodate.2 April 2026
:subject.Proofs for the spring catalogue
:ref.Order 2026/118
:memotxt memtype=EXTERNAL.
:p.Thank you for the second set of proofs, which reached us this
morning.  The colour on pages 4 to 9 is now right.
:p.Two things remain:
:ol.
:li.the caption on page 12 is cut off at the right;
:li.the index still refers to the old page numbers.
:eol.
:p.Once these are corrected we can approve the job for printing.
:sign.Tomás Ferreira
:cc name='Accounts, Northgate Press' email='accounts@example.org'.
